{"org":"oracle","repo":"graal","prNumber":"10135","commit":"c55983ced7d01676c68f4a4aaf33e0f9fc4dd23a","generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"In the case where `compilationActivityMode` is `SHUTDOWN_COMPILATION`, the method calls `queue.shutdownAndAwaitTermination(100)` on every invocation. Since `submitForCompilation` can be called frequently, repeatedly attempting to shut down the queue and awaiting termination—even if the executor has already terminated—introduces unnecessary overhead and potential latency in a hot path. This shutdown sequence should be triggered only once when transitioning to the shutdown state.","nodes":[{"id":"truffle/src/com.oracle.truffle.runtime/src/com/oracle/truffle/runtime/OptimizedTruffleRuntime.java-truffle/src/com.oracle.truffle.runtime/src/com/oracle/truffle/runtime/OptimizedTruffleRuntime.java-40081:40221,40230:40304-40274:40323,40332:40411,40420:42578,42587:42599","promptId":"#N4H71","srcPath":"truffle/src/com.oracle.truffle.runtime/src/com/oracle/truffle/runtime/OptimizedTruffleRuntime.java","dstPath":"truffle/src/com.oracle.truffle.runtime/src/com/oracle/truffle/runtime/OptimizedTruffleRuntime.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":40081,"endPos":40221,"startLine":917,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":917,"endLineOffset":148,"length":141},{"pos":40230,"endPos":40304,"startLine":918,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":918,"endLineOffset":82,"length":75}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":40274,"endPos":40323,"startLine":921,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":921,"endLineOffset":57,"length":50},{"pos":40332,"endPos":40411,"startLine":922,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":922,"endLineOffset":87,"length":80},{"pos":40420,"endPos":42578,"startLine":923,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":953,"endLineOffset":9,"length":2159},{"pos":42587,"endPos":42599,"startLine":954,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":954,"endLineOffset":20,"length":13}]}]},{"comment":"The fields `stoppedCompilationTime` and `logShutdownCompilations` are accessed and modified across multiple threads within `submitForCompil